{"title":"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_the_Beauty_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by the Beauty of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Real_number\" title=\"Real number\">real number</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/0/6d0382f3585219947b495ac2262a81b7b0c40db2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/6/06681f5b345750104366c512078960fee8d81b49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor x \\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"19\" /> denote the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Floor_function\" title=\"Floor function\">greatest integer</a> less than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/3/fc3be04db73828946870d3ccc6d122395a4bacf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"10\" /> For a certain <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Integer\" title=\"Integer\">integer</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/9/c99a6aaebc17474bd09ea71d84d4e769a0662b55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\" /> there are exactly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa94edfb9739dcc66dad90f7dd5c148f44a57e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/e/14e949b326c28044a70ee2a382fb014cf555a460.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n_{1}, n_{2}, \\ldots, n_{70}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"108\" height=\"11\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/a/a2a31bac0a2bc6d9943fbdf0ef0b1a3bc933895e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=\\lfloor\\sqrt[3]{n_{1}}\\rfloor = \\lfloor\\sqrt[3]{n_{2}}\\rfloor = \\cdots = \\lfloor\\sqrt[3]{n_{70}}\\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"287\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/f/c2f6ccfea1601212819f90d29b895c03989896e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n_{i}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/34857b3ba74ce5cd8607f3ebd23e9015908ada71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/7/ea7b4c567e9175db8ad5f0167078316ab8546765.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\leq i \\leq 70.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Find the maximum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/9/2d997bf873157d8d32bbe6bee73156b69137b0df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n_{i}}{k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"18\" height=\"33\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/3/563942ae50582ac15ce0aa0c35ba9b8eff7c1ce6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\leq i \\leq 70.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/3/34310f2f36ed6d724838edb08788ee62acb33386.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/3/9339e15771e9f6fd053bad1f11137bcb1e576985.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]{1} \\ldots \\sqrt[3]{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"77\" height=\"18\" /> all work, giving 7 integers. For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/69271b422e022ea65ff1f288eddfcfa82afd8ab7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, we see that in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/1/0b1b2a0bb4dfe13cdca56c74fc2872c55cc07fc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]{8} \\ldots \\sqrt[3]{26}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"86\" height=\"18\" />, all of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Even\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Even\">even</a> numbers work, giving 10 integers. For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/0/690ef55a607beaf2389d1ee102df817721bc2392.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, we get 13, and so on. We can predict that at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/6/cd67b74d4735ba01663051073d3bbe2dd78d4b39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 22$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" /> we get 70.\n</p><p>To prove this, note that all of the numbers from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/4/dd4c7646f276f40c0128e3ad6cdc26603f11629c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt[3]{x^3} \\ldots \\sqrt[3]{(x+1)^3 - 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"174\" height=\"32\" /> divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> work. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/2/592e319592e281a36280036cf6a477d70c102489.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(x+1)^3 - 1 - x^3}{x} + 1  = \\frac{3x^2 + 3x + 1 - 1}{x} + 1 = 3x + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"435\" height=\"39\" /> (the one to be inclusive) integers will fit the conditions. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/5/2350d352425604cbf29affc7093b5c3c1e8cb44a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3k + 4 = 70 \\Longrightarrow k = 22$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"184\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>The maximum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/e/dee5a262822f323b86df3c0a6df81a4f22572e7f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n_i = (x + 1)^3 - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"134\" height=\"19\" />. Therefore, the solution is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/9/9c94e88c2a98388c154209ba7a6b37bd27bc74e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{23^3 - 1}{22} = \\frac{(23 - 1)(23^2 + 23 + 1)}{22} = 529 + 23 + 1 = 553$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"438\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Obviously <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is positive. Then, we can let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/f/defbf06b987965438e5928b96688e48df84cba0e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" /> equal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/b/7bb87766bcaaf492fc1be5874b732197f6f0d641.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"17\" /> and similarly let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/b/7eb75ccf06e046206cb4c636a54d7be11d049fbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> equal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/2/e9202c6554313054a8c93f6bf0cf2b359fb5b713.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^3 + (i - 1)k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"101\" height=\"19\" />. \n</p><p>The wording of this problem (which uses \"exactly\") tells us that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/1/25170f760b0a52c21a10e5f26a24a4259aec6fb5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^3+69k&lt;(k+1)^3 = k^3 + 3k^2 + 3k+1 \\leq k^3+70k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"409\" height=\"19\" />. Taking away <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/b/7bb87766bcaaf492fc1be5874b732197f6f0d641.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"17\" /> from our inequality results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/3/463c632fa96f1e2f9e591d9e7f5425c927ed3033.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$69k&lt;3k^2+3k+1\\leq 70k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"203\" height=\"17\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/0/000da6099475500198505955f851264f5cd9ea96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$69k$\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/a/4fa762c11b261f327bbfb7add5e413490227a02f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3k^2+3k+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"98\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/a/1ba67c044f85d07b0c5c0787f2da48edb98b80e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$70k$\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" /> are all integers, this inequality is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/8/258f8152c7cbd87af7f7eec6ae30236eb04d6909.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$69k\\leq 3k^2+3k&lt;70k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"172\" height=\"17\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> is positive, we can divide the inequality by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/b/eabdb5b0bb2baffcc868e092954a4ba515002213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$69 \\leq 3k+3 &lt; 70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"134\" height=\"15\" />. Clearly the only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> that satisfies is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/9/779f8b02fafd2ec0eec3a40d2629f5d144eefc8f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=22$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />. \n</p><p>Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/8/608cbc4f001600f398ebad323b5c64b0b9451b6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n_{70}}{k}=k^2+69=484+69=\\boxed{553}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"266\" height=\"33\" /> is the maximum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/e/36e8ef33ba3150878078b401df2d20b830c016ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n_i}{k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"18\" height=\"33\" />. (Remember we set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/b/7eb75ccf06e046206cb4c636a54d7be11d049fbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/2/e9202c6554313054a8c93f6bf0cf2b359fb5b713.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k^3 + (i - 1)k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"101\" height=\"19\" />!)\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://youtu.be/by1QU7Tcsm0?si=4zE_EVcD0Q5ESxPJ\">2007 AIME II #7</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://mathproblemsolvingskills.wordpress.com/\">MathProblemSolvingSkills.com</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_the_Beauty_of_Math\">Video Solution by the Beauty of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by the Beauty of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/42kXJgD_b-A\">https://youtu.be/42kXJgD_b-A</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II\" title=\"2007 AIME II\">2007 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2007\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2007 AIME II Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017115507\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.058 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 321/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1806/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 128/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8505/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.669      1 -total\n 59.08%    8.076      1 Template:AIME_box\n 39.26%    5.366      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:4807:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017115507 and revision id 261106. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}